<title>USA: El Paso holders clear Tenneco Energy merger.</title>
<headline>El Paso holders clear Tenneco Energy merger.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Paso Energy Corp said Monday its stockholders approved the issuance of new common stock in preparation for the company's acquisition of Tenneco Energy.</p>
<p>The Tenneco Inc restructuring plan, which includes the merging of Tenneco Energy with El Paso Energy, will be presented to Tenneco shareholders Tuesday, El Paso noted.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
